=== Summary ===
Read-only overlay (no upperdir/workdir) eliminates upperdir issues.
Writes go to workspace/ and home/ via bind mount (local dirs here; production may bind a shared backend).
Read-only rootfs is enforced by the kernel (no copy-up overhead).

For Sandswap:
- Warm path: Negligible impact (reads are zero-overhead)
- Switch path: ~0.3ms overlay overhead + bind mount cost
- No NFS upperdir incompatibility (ro overlay works on any FS)
- No CleanupOverlay needed (stateless overlay)
